Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:46.86,Title,0,0,0,0,,《尖峰时刻2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国领事馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不叫警察去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我希望她们都是加州女孩 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I wish they all could be California girls ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:42.61,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 《沙滩小子》太棒了 - 我真的很爱《沙滩小子》\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Beach Boys are dope. - I love Beach Boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 美女 你们好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ladies, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去哪啊 我们去吃寿司吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, where you going? Let's get some sushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.76,0:03:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我希望她们都是… ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I wish they all could… ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那张CD是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my CD.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰中国人的CD\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever touch a Chinese man's CD.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到她们开车离开的样子吗 她们在嘲笑我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the way those girls drove off? They was laughing at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你吓走她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those girls drove off because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想请她们喝杯酒而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I did was invite them to have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想她们脱光光 然后献祭一头小羊羔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You invited them to get naked and sacrifice a small goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个字是「羊」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which word was goat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:24.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,你欠我一张《沙滩小子》精选集\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me a copy of the Beach Boys' greatest hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别给脸色我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be getting no attitude with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了三天 都是陪你查案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I been here three days. We done nothing but work your cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说会带我去玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only reason I'm here in Hong Kong is you said…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才来香港\N{\fnArial\fs30}you was gonna show me a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来度假 想要木须肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on vacation, man, and I want some mu sh…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,木须肉 你肚子饿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mu shu? You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 不是吃木须肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Lee, not mu shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是酒池肉林的肉 我想找女人乐一乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some mu shu. I wanna see some women, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装傻了 快带我去找美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop playing dumb and show me to the shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国领事馆爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个美国翻译官死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.48,0:03:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有什么线索
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为是谭瑞奇做的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 他全部帮派兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在那个夜总会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不愿接这个案件
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来度假 你又接了另一桩案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just take another damn case on my vacation, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有 我上司请我们去夜总会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not. My superintendent invited us to a club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今晚有个大派对 - 别耍我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big party tonight. - Don't be messing with me, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我一巴掌把你打回明朝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will slap you so hard, you'll end up in the Ming dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的啊 我还能一巴掌把你扇回曼谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it, man. I'll bitchslap you back to Bangkok.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大派对 - 很大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big party? - Big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们去派对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, let's go party then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不错 喂 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this is nice. Hey, cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们不喜欢游客 扮作本地人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't like tourists in here, so try to blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.11,0:04:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,扮本地人 我比所有人高两个头\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, blend in? I'm 2 feet taller than everybody in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪 - 厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you going? - Bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点回来 我们要玩个痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hurry back, man, because we're gonna party.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,超爽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你常来吗？这地方不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here a lot? It's a nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 带我们度过时光 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Take us through the hours ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我不会逼你的，宝贝 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I won't make you, baby ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,台上搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the world is going on up in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我在听这东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the only one listening to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.99,0:05:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他毁了这首经典金曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man destroying a classic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 给原力不要停下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ To the force don't stop ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不吃饱就不要停下来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't stop till you get enough ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 保持原力不要停止 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Keep on to the force don't stop ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不吃饱就不要停下来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't stop till you get enough ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 直到原力不停 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Till the force don't stop ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 直到原力不停 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Till the force don't stop ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不吃饱就不要停下来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't stop till you get enough ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep on I can't take no more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 靠近一点 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Get closer ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦，靠近一点 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, get closer ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我现在在燃烧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm burnin' now ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只是爱我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just love me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 直到你不知道 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Till you don't know how ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 保持原力，不要停下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Keep on to the force, don't stop ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不吃饱就不要停下来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't stop till you get enough ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 继续直到原力开始 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Keep on till the force starts up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 啊，等你够了再停 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Ah, don't stop till you get enough ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 继续直到原力开始 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Keep on till the force starts up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 女孩来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧，直到原力开始 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Come on, till the force starts up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 啊，在你之前别停下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Ah, don't stop till you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:06:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 直到你停下来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Don't stop till you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.87,0:07:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我真不敢相信 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I can't believe it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.67,0:07:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经被我电到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you feel the force!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦，喔，等你够了再停 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, whoa Don't stop till you get enough ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到电力十足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel the force!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.39,0:07:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡特 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carter! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 李 - 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Lee! - Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 来吧 - 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! Come on! - Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人超爱我的 快跟我上台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, these people love me, man. Come on out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 我可是个明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy, man? I'm a star!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人超级崇拜我的 来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a god to these people. Come check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.29,0:07:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是黑帮酒吧 我们来查案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a gangster bar. We are here undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你说谎 我一早就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you was lying. I knew you was lying, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个骗子 我们来找谭瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a liar! We are here to find Ricky Tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要低调行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must tread softly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,低调行事 你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tread softly? What in the world you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:07:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁教你这样查酒吧的 还低调行事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who taught you how to roust a bar? Tread softly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是三合会 中国最大的帮派\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men are Triads, the most deadly gang in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为那会吓倒我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮派是我们洛杉矶发明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from Los Angeles. We invented gangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警章给我 我给你看看 - 不 你在这儿是平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me that badge. I'll show youNo. - You are civilian!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在香港我是周星驰 你是「石斑鱼」\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Hong Kong, I'm Michael Jackson! You are Toto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说「跟班的」吧 石斑鱼是我们昨晚的晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Tito! Toto is what we ate last night for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把警章给我 拿来 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now give me that badge. Give it. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 大家听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了什么 - 你叫大家…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did I just say? - You just asked everybody…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起武士刀去切你的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pick up their samurai swords and shave your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我那样说的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said that? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.74,0:08:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来帮我翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out here and translate this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 大家听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有三合会和丑女人来这一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the Triads and the ugly women on this side…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有美女来另一边 立刻照做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the fine women on this side right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Translate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说所有男士站这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士站那里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你们假装听不到我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all gonna act like y'all don't hear what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.55,0:09:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁认识谭瑞奇 认识的举手\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, who in here know Ricky Tan? Raise your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.47,0:09:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位对不起 我朋友今天喝多了 现在有点傻傻的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间玩游戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't got time to be playing no games now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要… - 胡莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm taking. - Hu Li!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 嘿 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Hey, Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 洛杉矶警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the Way! L.A.P.D.!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.74,0:10:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee! Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, hell no. Uhuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, I'm taking the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开点 科比
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老伯对不起 继续吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.99,0:12:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.49,0:12:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 李 - 救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lee! - Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎样下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you get down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry UP!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let go, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 小心你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Watch out! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你后面 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? Behind you! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.69,0:12:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷啊 我不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Jesus, I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, help me, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 中国的竹子是很结实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Chinese bamboo is very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗？- 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure, man? - I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信我飞了一万英里 就为了来搅这滩浑水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I flew 10, 000 miles for this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you lied to me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 对不起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - You're sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被粗筷子插屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got somebody's old chopsticks stuck up my ass…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你只说声对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}all you gotta say to me is you sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了爆炸事件 - 关我屁事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There was an explosion. - I don't give a damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是美国领事馆 死了两个美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the American embassy. Two Americans were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为是谭瑞奇干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think this guy Ricky Tan blew up the embassy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么要找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell are you looking for him then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们找到他就知道了 - 是「你」自己去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna find out. - No, you gonna find out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有二十亿中国人呢 随便找个人做你搭档吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two billion Chinese people here. Let one of them be your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在什么鬼地方 - 桑拿浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell we at now? - Massage parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天上人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就要去享受按摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to go in here and get a massage…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.19,0:14:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,和热茶浴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a hot tea bath right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我指示行事 扮作游客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow my lead. Act like a tourist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.86,0:14:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来就是游客 白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a tourist, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢一点 你有病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Slow down, Chen! Hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 我的美国朋友在度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - My American friend is on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想带他找找乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna show him a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你是美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you American.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 你带了美金吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You bring American money?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:14:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 李 我请 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it, Lee. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.27,0:14:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来就好 - 你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:14:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.19,0:15:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不用客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位先生 请来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗？我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready? I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方简直好得冒泡 我爱香港\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is off the hook! I love Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试过被中国女郎按摩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get massage from Chinese girl before?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我听说会令人欲仙欲死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I heard it was the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.43,0:15:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给自己和你朋友挑个女孩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pick any girl for you and your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 任何一个 - 任何一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any girl? - Any girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.27,0:15:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.77,0:15:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道要挑谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我挑那边那个吧 - 对 她很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take that one. She got to come. - Oh, yes, she's very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她确实不错 但我扭伤了背和脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is nice, but I hurt my back and my neck…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多点按摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a little bit more massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要粉红色那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna take her in the pink too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:15:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 还有她 喂 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yes. - Let me get her. Hey, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要她 我可以挑她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then let me have her. Can I get her too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边那位 她脚底按摩拿手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her right there. She good with feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿手 - 你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yes. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说可以随便挑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said I could have any girl I want in here. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就快点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.63,0:16:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能在秀色可餐的肉林面前 催黑人兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you don'tjump in front of a black man in a buffet line.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得 你的朋友胃口很大啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have toYour friend has big appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,请跟她上楼去安静的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, follow her upstairs into the quiet room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那间房不会再静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't gonna be no quiet room no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.23,0:16:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不知道这有多舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all don't know how good this feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨晚跟三合会大打出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got in a big fight last night with the Triads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过三合会吗？我一个人击退了20人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever heard of the Triads? I beat down like 20 of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你们看不到我多厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all should've seen me, it was on. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 李 李 - 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lee.Lee. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.54,0:16:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I'm talking about, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我才感觉在度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不会令我失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd come through. I just knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}America?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跟我回美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna come to America with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去过美国没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever been to America?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 你的女孩怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, how's your girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 李 怎么了 - 那是谭瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lee, what's wrong? - That's Ricky Tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.23,0:17:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭瑞奇 那个穿浴袍的小侏儒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Ricky Tan? That's a midget in a bathrobe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去叫后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will call for backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才四英尺高 我们去抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, the man is 4 feet tall. Let's go bust him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.07,0:17:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a very dangerous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是危险人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a very dangerous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过去抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, let's go over there and bust him, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.74,0:17:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别打扰我按摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not about to mess up my massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 留在这里 - 你不需要后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay here. - You don't need backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是你的后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一分钟 一分钟就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me for a minute. Just for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.84,0:17:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.63,0:17:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇 谭瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky? Ricky Tan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来吧 老兄 我到处找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, dog. I've been looking for you everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm busy at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到我讲话吗？我也很忙 站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear what I said? I'm busy too. Now get on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up! Get on your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你 你是李的美国朋友 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you. You are Lee's American friend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是李的新保镖 别因这浴袍的颜色而小看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm Lee's new muscle. And don't let this robe fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:17:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只剩下这个颜色 我叫你站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only color they had left. Now I said, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't gonna say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们美国人真滑稽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You American are so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们亚洲人都耳背啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you Asians don't hear that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Ricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的混帐屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your little punk ass up…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开那张椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of that chair right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你破坏我的假期 我叫你站起来 听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're messing up my vacation. Now, I told you to get up, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.31,0:18:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在我不得不发飙了 - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now I gotta go off on you. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来收拾他 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me bust his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来教训他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.77,0:18:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久没见你了 你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.86,0:18:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些事情想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你跟我回警察局
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.19,0:18:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于两个美国人被杀的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.95,0:18:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么严重
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事情你可以在这里跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.45,0:18:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 小矮子 跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, little man. You coming with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想赔你笔记本电脑 我必须得陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to pay you for that laptop. I think I should do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用了 - 赔最新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No problem. - I can get you a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在网上见到有款可以放DVD的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen it on the internet with DVD player.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那台是旧款 现在请恕失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an old model. Now, I must excuse myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩开心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.14,0:19:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.31,0:19:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛不告诉我他那么人强马壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, why didn't you tell me this man rolls like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.07,0:19:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我告诉过你 - 不 你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you! - You didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有 - 你说过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did. - What you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做过这个表情 - 那表示什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did this. - What do "this" mean, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用英文说 - 表示我去这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Speak English to me! - That means I go this way…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去那边 - 我去那边 你去这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you, this way. - I go that way, you, this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 你们样子都差不多 - 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unh! Sorry, man. All y'all look alike! - Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.72,0:19:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得你生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! No wonder you mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.27,0:20:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是出去一下比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 翻转我 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Flip me! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻转我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flip me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.87,0:20:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.43,0:21:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.01,0:21:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 李 - 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lee! - Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 公安局命令你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Look, you've been ordered by the Ministry of Public Security…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.97,0:21:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,协助联邦调查局和特勤局查案\N{\fnArial\fs30}to assist the FBI and Secret Service in our investigation…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.89,0:21:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供我们一切所需\N{\fnArial\fs30}to provide us with whatever we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你有情报 一定要告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have information, it belongs to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是香港\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is still Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个美国人在美国政府大楼被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two Americans have been killed on United States government property.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.11,0:22:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我两份影本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me two copies of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.16,0:22:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,李总督察会指挥你的人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Inspector Lee will supervise your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他要听我指挥 你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he will report to me. Do we understand each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是何方神圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.67,0:22:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是李总督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, uh, Chief Inspector Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生从没感到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't never been humiliated and embarrassed like that…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么尴尬及耻辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my whole entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱光光在香港到处跑 多谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got me running around Hong Kong buttnaked, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.40,0:22:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢我？- 对 多多感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks to me? - Yeah, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要后援 我说给你后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}You needed backup, so I gave you backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.44,0:22:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快要痛扁谭瑞奇 和他的小弟们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to kick Ricky Tan's ass, and his bodyguards'…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.19,0:22:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你却来坏事 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- till you messed it up. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.65,0:22:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我受够你的废话了 - 是我受够你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sick of your bullshit. - I'm sick of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我要去黑帮酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the one running up in karaoke bars full of gangsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我要去桑拿浴室找犯罪头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the one running up in massage parlors looking for crime lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.95,0:22:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我的职责所在 - 职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's my job. - It's your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.00,0:23:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怜 你何时才能去找找乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pitiful, man. When are you gonna have some fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何时才能休个假 去约约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you gonna take a day off? Go on a date or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.92,0:23:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有很多约会 - 什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have plenty of dates. - When?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次约会是何时你倒是说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time you had a date, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.76,0:23:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次玩「滚床单」是何时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time you played Hide the Rainbow Roll, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.47,0:23:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来听听 是鼠年那年吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it, Lee. The year of the rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.47,0:23:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远不会了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.18,0:23:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我连你刚才说什么也不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You right. I didn't even understand what you just said to me right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.61,0:23:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的护照留在桑拿浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got my passport back at that massage parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.07,0:23:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,午安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.07,0:23:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 李 - 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lee. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.41,0:23:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是美国特勤局的史特林\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Special Agent Sterling from the United States Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.54,0:23:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,特勤局 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secret Service? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.46,0:23:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.71,0:23:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备告诉你的事必须保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm about to tell you cannot leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.84,0:23:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天被杀的并非美国翻译员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men who were killed yesterday were not American translators.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是美国海关的卧底探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were undercover United States customs agents…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.72,0:23:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务是粉碎一个三合会走私集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to break a Triad smuggling ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.05,0:23:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走私什么 - 我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smuggling what? - We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.85,0:23:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论走私什么 导致他们被杀有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whatever it is, it got the agents killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.64,0:24:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以怎么协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你别妨碍我们办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay the hell out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.90,0:24:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.69,0:24:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你谭瑞奇的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you Ricky Tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.53,0:24:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必 我们对他了如指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We know all about Tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.11,0:24:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们放他在外边作饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're leaving him out there as bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.74,0:24:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,幕后组织比谭瑞奇的福苍龙帮大得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a lot bigger than Ricky Tan and the Fu Cang Long Triads.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.75,0:24:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter! Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.56,0:25:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天上人间桑拿浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Heaven on Earth massage parlor?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.48,0:25:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,天上人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven on Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.44,0:25:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 便宜唐装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Cheap suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.70,0:25:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 便宜唐装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Cheap suits. Cheap suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.03,0:25:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,便宜唐装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheap suits. Cheap suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.62,0:25:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有多便宜 - 便宜唐装\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How cheap? - Cheap suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.66,0:25:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,便宜到死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheap as hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.72,0:26:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.47,0:26:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you direct me…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.72,0:26:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天上人间桑拿浴室在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Heaven on Earth massage parlor, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.89,0:26:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈罗 你好吗 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. How are you? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.44,0:26:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.69,0:26:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我不要鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't want no chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.19,0:26:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.15,0:26:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不要鸡 我要只鸡来干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I don't want no chicken. What am I gonna do with a chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.24,0:26:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢活鸡 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like my chickens live, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.04,0:26:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢油炸的死鸡 听过大力水手炸鸡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like them dead and deepfried. You ever heard of Popeye's?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.00,0:26:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.17,0:26:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别杀那只鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh. Don't kill chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.42,0:26:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.01,0:26:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是警察 放下刀 放开那只鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a police officer. Put the blade down and let the bird go right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.85,0:26:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Lee?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是想吃木须肉罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he wanted was some mu shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.29,0:27:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 计程车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, taxi! Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.04,0:27:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.34,0:27:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着那车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.47,0:27:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着那辆礼车 我要追他 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, follow that limo. This is a chase, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.30,0:27:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去哪里 你都要跟着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever he goes, you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.26,0:27:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没在动啊 这跟「追」是相反的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not moving! This is the opposite of chasing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.18,0:27:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你再不开我就揍你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I will slap you if you don't move this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要揍你啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna slap you. I'm gonna slap you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.40,0:27:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.36,0:27:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 现在听得懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.95,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在懂你说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're speaking my language.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.95,0:27:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车呀 快点 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell on then. Come on, Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.59,0:28:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,香港水警刚有电话来说谭瑞奇
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.21,0:28:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在船上开派对 我想自己去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.09,0:28:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有通知史特林
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.68,0:28:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有通知他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.68,0:28:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要香港警方自己来处理
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.67,0:29:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里等我 我立刻回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait right here. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.59,0:29:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗？- 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You understand? - Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.63,0:29:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别吃我的鸡 好吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And don't eat my chicken, okay? - Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.22,0:29:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.47,0:29:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.80,0:29:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.05,0:30:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.43,0:30:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卡特 詹姆斯卡特 来自鲍德温山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter. James Carter. Baldwin hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.18,0:30:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莎贝拉莫莉娜 圣胡安来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isabella Molina. From San Juan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.39,0:30:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣胡安\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Juan? Mmhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.77,0:31:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我搭我的私人飞机 去过好几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know San Juan. I've traveled there many times on my private plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.57,0:31:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定认识我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must know my good friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.11,0:31:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩德罗莫拉莱斯麻冈萨雷斯 莫兰多莫拉索蒙多斯托斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pedro Morales Magonzales Marato Molaso Mondustos.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.03,0:31:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不认识 - 你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think so, no. - You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.24,0:31:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我以为你很熟上流社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmhm. Well, I'm sorry. I thought you rode in the best of circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.24,0:31:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 当自己家好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But listen, make yourself feel at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.33,0:31:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你需要什么 香槟 鱼子酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need anything, champagne, caviar…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.12,0:31:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的游艇就是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}my yacht is your yacht.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.29,0:31:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘游艇是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your yacht?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.59,0:31:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是船主\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. I'm the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.50,0:31:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}The captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.76,0:31:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.80,0:31:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想跟你玩游戏 我现在就想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna play games with you. I want you, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.64,0:31:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以想像我们五分钟后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see me and you downstairs in one of those bathrooms…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.60,0:31:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在楼下浴室打得火热\N{\fnArial\fs30}in about five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.77,0:31:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很心动 这艘船这么美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm very tempted. It's such a beautiful yacht.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.19,0:31:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.53,0:31:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它叫什么名字 - 你的游艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's it called? - Mmhm. Your yacht.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.53,0:31:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,SS米诺强森\N{\fnArial\fs30}The S.S. Minnow Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.03,0:31:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- SS米诺强森吗？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The S.S. Minnow Johnson? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.70,0:31:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪 船尾明明写着赤龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny. The name on the back was the Red Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.74,0:31:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,赤龙 你确定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Dragon? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.66,0:32:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.96,0:32:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是我朋友的游艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this is my friend's yacht.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.87,0:32:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你朋友的游艇 - 这是他的派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your friend's yacht? - And this is his party.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.34,0:32:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定是上错船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must've got on the wrong yacht.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.05,0:32:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些船都差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these yachts look just alike these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.17,0:32:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的锁匙开不了门时 就知道不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew something was wrong when my key didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.59,0:32:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这位朋友是谁 - 上错船的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's your friend? - Somebody who got on the wrong yacht.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.56,0:32:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我认识你 史蒂芬瑞恩 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait a second. I know you. Steven Reign, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.52,0:32:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拥有半个洛杉矶 来香港干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You own half of Los Angeles. What you doing out here in Hong Kong?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.89,0:32:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,度周末 看风景\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here for the weekend, taking in the sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.15,0:32:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定也有私人飞机了 很过瘾吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have your own plane too. It's fun, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.86,0:32:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走走好吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.07,0:32:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩开心点 卡特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, enjoy the party, Mr. Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.70,0:32:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正有此意 伊莎贝拉小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I plan to, Miss Isabella.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.16,0:32:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见 史蒂芬 保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, Stevie. Be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.55,0:32:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭瑞奇在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky Tan. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.64,0:32:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.89,0:32:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今天杀了一个探员 他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed a detective today. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.81,0:33:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who got killed, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.73,0:33:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡特 - 李 谁死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carter! - Who died, Lee?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.81,0:33:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 倪探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You! - Detective Yu?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.90,0:33:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是倪 是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Yu, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.27,0:33:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁 - 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - You!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.57,0:33:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.32,0:33:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明不明白我嘴巴说出来的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand the words that are coming out of my mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.36,0:33:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会明白你嘴巴说出来的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't nobody understand the words that are coming out of your mouth, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.91,0:33:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭瑞奇在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky Tan is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.08,0:33:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 这里到底发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on here, Lee?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.17,0:33:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我告诉过你我爸爸是警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember I told you my father was a policeman?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.46,0:33:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 谭瑞奇是他的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Ricky Tan was his partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.17,0:33:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.67,0:33:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡莉 别跟我胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.01,0:33:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘记你从哪来的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.06,0:33:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你长大了现在
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.02,0:33:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有翅膀 你可以飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.04,0:33:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚 他妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.36,0:33:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 我在等你 叫你搭档在里面等吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, I've been expecting you. Please ask your partner to wait inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.70,0:34:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我哪儿也不去 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hell, no. I ain't going nowhere. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.45,0:34:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 李 我不会留下你一个 - 我不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not leaving you alone, Lee. - I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.00,0:34:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗 - 确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.42,0:34:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在楼上等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.46,0:34:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到谣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what everybody's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.71,0:34:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,领事馆不是我炸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not blow up the American embassy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.09,0:34:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那么笨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not that stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.93,0:34:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我相信是我手下做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I believe some of my people did.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的死对头想嫁祸我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My enemies are trying to frame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.81,0:34:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在三合会正在起内哄\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a war going on right now within the Triads.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.44,0:34:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕这次我会输\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'm gonna lose this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.28,0:34:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲若还活着 我会求教于他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your father were still alive, I would turn to him for advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.49,0:34:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你别提他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.53,0:34:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 我需要你帮忙 我信不过别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, I really need your help. I cannot trust anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.16,0:34:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他们为何要杀海关人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why they killed the customs agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.91,0:34:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么情报我都可以给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you all the information you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.38,0:34:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要立刻把我弄离香港\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've gotta get me out of Hong Kong right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.67,0:35:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, lady, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.55,0:35:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来 我是洛杉矶警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down. I'm L.A.P.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.68,0:35:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚踢我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just kick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.22,0:35:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be out of your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.47,0:35:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想挑战我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.72,0:35:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,想试试洛杉矶警察的厉害吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna give you an L.A.P.D. asskicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.92,0:36:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.96,0:36:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我滑倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slipped and I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.34,0:36:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.59,0:36:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有流血吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.94,0:36:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,督察 今晚很热闹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a night, inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.86,0:36:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭瑞奇是我们唯一的饵 现在他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky Tan was our only bait. Now he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.24,0:36:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的仇报了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got your revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.95,0:36:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,代价是毁了美国政府的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the expense of a United States government investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.70,0:36:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,报仇 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revenge? What are you talking about, revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.87,0:36:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不清楚是三合会 收买你去杀谭瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know if the Triads paid you to get rid of Tan…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.87,0:36:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是你纯为了报复而杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if it was a pure vendetta killing…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.08,0:36:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者你根本与走私有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if you're involved in the smuggling yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.71,0:36:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你别再碰此案\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're off this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.00,0:37:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再见到你 清楚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't ever wanna see you again. Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.30,0:37:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 发生了什么事 - 卡特 你已经惹了够多麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, what's going on here? - Carter, you're in enough trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.17,0:37:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.55,0:37:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,少管闲事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.14,0:37:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你立刻回洛杉矶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going back to L.A. right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.30,0:37:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 反正来这里之后 玩得也不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's fine with me, man. I ain't had fun since I been out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.73,0:37:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.23,0:37:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.69,0:37:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 护送卡特探员去机场 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Escort Detective Carter to the airport. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.65,0:37:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.24,0:37:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们给我放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.33,0:37:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.96,0:37:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I understand all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.59,0:37:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被人推下楼 被殴打\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got knocked off a building, I got beat on…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.88,0:37:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,被扒光 而你仍然不肯对我说真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got stripped buttnaked, and you held out on me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.63,0:37:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.31,0:37:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 谭瑞奇出卖我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, Ricky Tan set up my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.73,0:37:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.19,0:38:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年前我爸在调查一宗国际走私案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years ago, my father was working a big international smuggling case.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.45,0:38:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发现他的搭档谭瑞奇 原来替三合会卖命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found out his partner, Tan, was working for the Triads.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.70,0:38:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在他找到证据之前就被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before he could prove it, he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.71,0:38:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,证据全消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the evidence disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.67,0:38:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭辞职 留下悬案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tan resigned, and the case was never solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.21,0:38:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了 全因你爸爸最后那件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I get it now. This is all about your daddy's last case.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.30,0:38:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你跟我上飞机吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you getting on the plane with me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.35,0:38:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.60,0:38:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我爸爸也是殉职的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my daddy died on the job too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.39,0:38:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以找到凶手 我也会不顾一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had a chance to square his death, I'd do whatever it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会不择手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.77,0:38:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你到底来不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you coming or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.91,0:38:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要去洛杉矶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why L.A.?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.62,0:38:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我向你简介\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, let me introduce you…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.04,0:38:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特的办案理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Carter's theory of criminal investigation:
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.50,0:38:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟踪有钱白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the rich white man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.46,0:39:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟踪有钱白人？- 对 好好学\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow the rich white man? - Exactly. Now you're learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.04,0:39:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,每桩大案幕后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every big crime has a rich white man behind it…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.38,0:39:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有个有钱白人\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for his cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.63,0:39:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这桩案子来说 我们知道有钱的白人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, in our case, we know who the rich white man is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史蒂芬瑞恩 - 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Steven Reign. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.64,0:39:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,饭店大亨 他在谭瑞奇的船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steven Reign, the hotel billionaire. I saw him on Ricky Tan's boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.01,0:39:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪战发生时 他太冷静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the shooting started, he was way too cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.31,0:39:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人开枪的话 白人不会那么冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}When people start shooting, white people ain't that cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.06,0:39:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会乱窜 躲在桌子底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They either running around, hiding behind tables…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.56,0:39:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,或像这样尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}or screaming like, "Aah"!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.73,0:39:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常那样叫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. You sound like that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.44,0:39:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是我们黑人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you something about black people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.32,0:39:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到暴力事件时很冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}When stuff goes down, we keep our cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.86,0:39:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不及亚洲人 我们永不恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, but not like Asians. We never panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.20,0:39:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 哥吉拉来时你们都吓趴下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. When Godzilla's coming, y'all be tripping.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.79,0:39:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过那部电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seen the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.04,0:39:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会喊 「救命」 - 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You be, "Gaioa, gaica"! - Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.87,0:39:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到处尖叫 - 就\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yelling everywhere. - Just.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.25,0:39:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特先生 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Carter, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.17,0:39:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.42,0:39:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是犹太餐吗？- 是 这是我们提供的犹太餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the kosher meal? Shalom. - Yes, sir, our kosher meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.23,0:40:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在那里 史蒂芬瑞恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is. Mr. Steven Reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.06,0:40:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的顶楼豪宅内尽享奢华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living large in one of his penthouse suites.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜我见到谁是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, guess who this is. Yep, that's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.62,0:40:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在谭瑞奇游艇上的那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the woman that was on Ricky Tan's boat, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.58,0:40:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.33,0:40:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说行得通嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you it'd work out. Know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.12,0:40:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只要等\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we gotta do now is wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.50,0:40:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仍在谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still talking? Mmhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.88,0:40:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.17,0:40:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会回来的 - 你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'll be back. - How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.26,0:40:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到那女人多美吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. You see how fine that woman is?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.51,0:40:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll definitely be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.27,0:40:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.77,0:40:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.40,0:40:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是站着 没做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just standing around, not doing much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.32,0:40:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just don't fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.82,0:40:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早会有事发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, something's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.99,0:40:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我尽量不睡 真是闷死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I just try to stay awake. It's just so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.67,0:41:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢一点 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Slow down, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.71,0:41:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.96,0:41:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我没说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Nothing. I said nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.88,0:41:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说话了 - 没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said something. - I said nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.84,0:41:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听见你嘀咕什么了 - 没有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard you say something. - No, no, no. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.52,0:41:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 怎么回事 你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, what's going on, man? What you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.40,0:41:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在脱衣服 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's getting undressed. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.44,0:41:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她正在脱衣服 - 给我那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's getting undressed. - Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.36,0:41:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.95,0:41:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样很不道德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.41,0:41:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天爷 放过我 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lord, have mercy! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.74,0:41:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她脱下裙子 - 噢 我不要再听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She took her skirt off. - Oh, I cannot hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.58,0:41:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色内裤 黑色胸罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black panties, black bra.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.42,0:41:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,维多莉亚的秘密春季目录27页\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victoria's Secret, spring catalog, page 27.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.88,0:41:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有品味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girl got class.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.76,0:41:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我近一点看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me look a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.38,0:41:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那小刺青 真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at that. Got a little tattoo. That's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.43,0:41:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来像 史努比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Snoopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.10,0:42:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史努比 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Snoopy? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.35,0:42:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱史努比 - 等等 我也爱史努比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love Snoopy. - Wait. I love Snoopy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.31,0:42:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me look at this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.31,0:42:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.98,0:42:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走向门口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going to the door. Wait. She's going to the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.65,0:42:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她开门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's opening the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.99,0:42:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有人送来一个包裹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look like somebody dropping off a package.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.57,0:42:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.95,0:42:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是和送包裹到你办公室的 是同一个女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look like the same girl who dropped off the package at your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.74,0:42:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是炸弹 - 炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a bomb! - Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.20,0:42:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.88,0:42:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是这道门 小姐 有炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this one right here, I think. Hey, you got a bomb in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.17,0:42:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.63,0:42:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,踢门吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.55,0:42:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the he? - No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.55,0:42:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 你好美 - 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn, you fine. - Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.22,0:42:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 李 来 - 去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Lee! Come on! - Where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.35,0:42:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别丢掉 这边来 - 我们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't drop it! Come on, this way! - Where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.32,0:42:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roof! Roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.99,0:42:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别绊倒小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't trip! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.37,0:43:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 李 扔掉 - 扔去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Throw it, Lee! - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.37,0:43:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扔出去 - 扔哪儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Throw it! - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.62,0:43:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把炸弹从大厦边缘扔出去扔啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw the bomb over the edge! Throw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.29,0:43:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把炸弹从大厦边扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it! Throw it over the edge!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.29,0:43:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 下面很多人 - 扔呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's people down there! - Throw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.17,0:43:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡特 - 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carter! Carter! - Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.00,0:43:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 李 - 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lee! - Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.25,0:43:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扔啊 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Throw it! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.51,0:43:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We about to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.60,0:43:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, get on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.43,0:43:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玩够了吧 - 放下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enough! - Put that down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.06,0:43:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是炸弹 - 放下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a bomb! hey! - Put that down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.94,0:43:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 没有炸弹 什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, no bomb. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.98,0:43:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,再搅局我就抓你们去坐牢 告你们妨碍执法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now stay away before I throw you both in jail for obstruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.65,0:43:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓我们去坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw us in jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.99,0:43:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了 我才正要抓你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be out of your mind. I'm about to bust you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.74,0:43:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是美国特勤局的卧底探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an undercover agent for the United States Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.83,0:43:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎知道真假 拿徽章来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know that? Show me a badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.46,0:43:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.04,0:43:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我再看一次 我没看清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that again. I didn't get a good look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.21,0:43:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以帮你 我是香港来的探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can help you. I'm a detective from Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.30,0:44:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁 李督察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are, Inspector Lee. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.72,0:44:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要避人耳目\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to go out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.22,0:44:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去我房间吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So come down to my suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.35,0:44:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛说那是炸弹 - 是你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now why did you say it was a bomb? - No, you said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.77,0:44:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 是你 - 你在酒店房里说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you said it. - You said that in the hotel room.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.02,0:44:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说她是肉弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said she was the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.90,0:44:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是肉弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.11,0:44:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查这案子已经几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, I've been working this case for months now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.70,0:44:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 若我刚才发了脾气 我道歉 - 你要告诉我们是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So if I seem aggravated, I apologize. - You need to tell us what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.45,0:44:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,三合会和瑞恩以为我是贪污的关员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Triads and Reign, they think I'm a crooked customs agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.70,0:44:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些钱是贿款吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a payoff?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.04,0:44:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's a sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.33,0:44:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有听过超级钞票吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys ever heard of the Superbill?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.17,0:44:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是神话 伪钞的一种吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's a myth. Some kind of counterfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.25,0:44:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那并非一般的伪钞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, it's much more than a counterfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.09,0:44:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五家世界银行中 有十四家分辨不出差别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourteen out of 15 world banks can't even tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.34,0:44:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,用美钞专用纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The paper is Crane linen blend…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.01,0:44:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,及美钞印钞机印的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the bills are printed on U.S. intaglio presses.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.26,0:44:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么进入美国造币厂用印钞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us how they get into the U.S. mint to use the presses.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.02,0:44:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,1959年 美国跟伊朗王十分友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1959, the United States was very friendly with the shah of Iran.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.94,0:44:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 因为我们想要他的石油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Because we wanted his oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.19,0:44:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我国政府送了他一份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our government gave him a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.44,0:45:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国的印钞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}A U.S. treasury intaglio printing press.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.40,0:45:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是唯一一部离开美国本土的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it's the only one to ever leave the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.82,0:45:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,五年前 谭瑞奇从黑市买到那部机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five years ago, Ricky bought the press on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.57,0:45:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五年前 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five years ago? - Mmhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.03,0:45:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正是他离开警方之前 - 今年初\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right before he left the force. - Earlier this year, Ricky Tan got ahold…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.00,0:45:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭瑞奇得到瑞士制的百元钞票印版\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Swissmade hundred dollar plates…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.00,0:45:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他便开始印超级钞票\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he started printing Superbills.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.33,0:45:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡莉为了印版杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why Hu Li killed him. For the plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.38,0:45:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已印制和运走了一亿元\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they've printed and shipped $100 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.59,0:45:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个方法分辨真伪\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way to spot a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.72,0:45:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用印度油墨 烧起来会变红色\N{\fnArial\fs30}They use an optical transfer ink from India that burns red.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.93,0:45:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而真钞烧起来是黑色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? Now, the real ink, it burns black.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.31,0:45:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打算用一亿元伪钞来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what in the hell they gonna do with a hundred million of phony money?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.77,0:45:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 我相信你问错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Carter, I believe you're asking the wrong question.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.19,0:45:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该问印版在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real question is where are the plates?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.95,0:45:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因找到印版 就可制止整个行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can find the plates, we can stop the whole operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.20,0:45:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吗 - 对 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? - Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.33,0:45:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有一个办法你们可帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is where you can help us, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.12,0:45:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 这是你的地头 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I mean, Carter, this is your city, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.67,0:46:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这是我乳头 不 地头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is my titty. I mean, this is my city.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.26,0:46:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.51,0:46:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 你认识胡莉和三合会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lee, you know Hu Li and the Triads, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.47,0:46:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 认识 - 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.84,0:46:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我个忙 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So can you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.43,0:46:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可否帮我查出 胡莉把印版藏在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you find out where Hu Li's keeping the plates?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.93,0:46:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't no problem.Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.39,0:46:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 欢迎加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}So welcome aboard, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.06,0:46:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这刻起 你们就为\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this moment on, you're officially working…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.40,0:46:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,特勤局工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the United States Secret Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.82,0:46:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,特勤局探员詹姆斯卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secret Service agent James Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.65,0:46:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好听 听起来很顺耳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, that sounds good. It's got a nice ring to it, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.03,0:46:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, give me six months. Six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.91,0:46:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我便会升去华盛顿保护总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be in Washington, D.C. protecting the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.58,0:46:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道 你从不为别人挡子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know you would never take a bullet for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.42,0:46:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但他们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but they don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.96,0:46:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去问问伊莎贝拉 有没有门路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna talk to Isabella, see if she can hook something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.59,0:46:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到她望着我的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing the way she was staring at a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.67,0:46:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她连看也没看你一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never even looked at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.01,0:46:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 你妒忌了吧 因她看中我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just jealous, Lee, because the girl chose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.72,0:46:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我魁梧英俊 皮肤古铜 你是第三世界的丑男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm tall, dark and handsome. And you Third World ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.31,0:46:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不丑 女人都很喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Third World ugly. Women like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.68,0:46:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们觉得我很可爱 像史努比\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think I'm cute, like Snoopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.73,0:47:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,史努比比你还高六寸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, Snoopy is 6 inches taller than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.90,0:47:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史特林 - 李和卡特正式\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sterling. - Lee and Carter are officially…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.74,0:47:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会妨碍特勤局了 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of the Secret Service's way. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.91,0:47:17.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克伦萧厨房 正宗中式料理）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.55,0:47:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我线人的餐馆 排骨相当不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my informant's place. They got pretty good ribs here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.05,0:47:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢犹太餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like kosher.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.73,0:47:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.16,0:47:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道我没想到眼前会是这幅情景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know I don't think I see what I see what I'm thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.49,0:47:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们都不是在赌钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know good and well y'all ain't gambling back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.95,0:48:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是中国餐馆啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is supposed to be a Chinese restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.04,0:48:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干嘛 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you doing in here, James?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.42,0:48:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的朋友快要坐牢了 大家收拾东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You about to go to jail. You about to go to jail, and all your little friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.59,0:48:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离开这里 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pack up your stuff! Let's go! - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.05,0:48:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们外面谈吧 - 你想去外面谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's talk outside. - You wanna talk outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.22,0:48:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 走吧 你想谈我奉陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Let's go then. You wanna talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.51,0:48:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你想谈就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you wanna talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.77,0:48:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪里买的这件衣服 不错哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you get that from? I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.77,0:48:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错 你好吗 肯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. What's up, Kenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.06,0:48:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯卡特 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- James Carter. - What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.61,0:48:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你在香港被打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you was getting your ass kicked out there in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.11,0:48:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.36,0:48:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了 谁告诉你的 - 我有线人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You crazy. Who told you that? - I got my sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.70,0:48:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就别担心了 - 他们说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you worry about that. - They telling you lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不给我情报我就抓你去坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to bust you if you don't give me some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.99,0:48:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛跑来这样恐吓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you gonna come up here and jam me up like this, James? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.21,0:48:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我老婆孩子面前丢我脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You embarrass me in front of my wife, my kids out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.25,0:48:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己丢脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenny, you embarrassing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.00,0:48:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑人在克伦萧黑人区开中国餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a black man with a Chinese restaurant on Crenshaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.09,0:48:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闯进来 又没出示警章\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come up in here, you ain't show me no badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.34,0:48:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,连搜查令也没秀一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't even flashed a warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.14,0:48:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我要干什么吗 打得你满地找牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what I'm gonna do for you? I'm gonna whup your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.72,0:49:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再打得你满地找牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I'm gonna whup your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.52,0:49:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼 我们倒想见识见识 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenny, we'd love to see that. We would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.19,0:49:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来啊 肯尼 - 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Kenny! Come on, Kenny! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.73,0:49:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪啊 我会开枪 然后说你在厨房跌倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it! I'll shoot, say you fell in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.90,0:49:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来啊 - 你最好冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - You better chill out, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.03,0:49:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯尼 冷静点 - 嘿 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kenny, calm down! - Hey, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.62,0:49:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenny!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.46,0:49:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎爪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twisting tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.05,0:49:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪里学来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you learn that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.84,0:49:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,程师父教我的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.05,0:49:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 北京的程师父 - 不是 克伦萧区的弗莱迪程教我的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.89,0:49:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.22,0:49:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, all right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.89,0:49:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你会和711一起
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.14,0:49:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,711？\N{\fnArial\fs30}711?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.02,0:49:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远都不知道闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.36,0:49:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我听懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I heard that. I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.40,0:49:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说我坏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be talking about me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.57,0:49:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来查伪钞的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are here about some funny money.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.37,0:50:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.70,0:50:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一百元的伪钞吧 - 对 这里有人用伪钞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cnotes, right? - Yeah. Any of them came through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.58,0:50:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个熟客\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of my regulars came in here a few days ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.92,0:50:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天前输了五万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}dropped about 50 large on the tables in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.55,0:50:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要找兄弟们去找他算账\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to go down there with my boys and tune his ass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.63,0:50:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他第二天来了 还清了全额\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he comes in the next day with the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.84,0:50:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是顺号码的百元新钞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandnew 100dollar bills, sequential.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.64,0:50:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是假的 因为他 只是领一般薪水而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure they're fake because this guy's got a regular day job.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.60,0:50:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我验过那些钞票 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I test them, and they checked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.06,0:50:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,钞票还在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still have the bills?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.48,0:50:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩下一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got my lunch money from the third grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.90,0:50:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.80,0:50:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.14,0:51:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.72,0:51:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他骗了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.98,0:51:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说是谁给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you say gave that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.48,0:51:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫小京 在瑞恩广场工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cat named Zing. Work down at Reign Plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.77,0:51:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我找到他前 你们最好找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, you better hope you find him before I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.40,0:51:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.09,0:51:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 洛杉矶警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. L.A.P.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.38,0:51:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想找个叫小京的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for a guy named Zing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.06,0:51:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我站住 回来 快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Come here! Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.39,0:51:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! You little rascal!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.10,0:51:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻给我滚回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.10,0:51:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.41,0:52:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是鼎鼎有名的李督察
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.29,0:52:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 干掉你 江湖上我就更有名了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.21,0:52:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我都不知道我来干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh. You know what? I don't even know why the hell I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.00,0:52:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是中国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't even Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.46,0:52:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.09,0:52:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想有人想先跟他们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's someone who would like to talk to them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.06,0:52:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛这么暴力 有必要吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do that for? Unnecessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.86,0:52:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的补牙踢崩了 你要赔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You done knocked out my filling, girl. That's gonna cost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.95,0:52:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没打过女人 是你逼我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't never hit a woman, but your ass is pushing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.17,0:52:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.59,0:52:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.92,0:53:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我等着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.58,0:53:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.84,0:53:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.05,0:53:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.30,0:53:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫伊莎贝拉的女人把你打晕了 她耍了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That lady Isabella knock you out, that's what happened. She played you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.59,0:53:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Yes, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.97,0:53:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她救了我们的命 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She save our life. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.01,0:53:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 否则我们已被胡莉杀了 - 你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hu Li could have killed us. - Lee, are you crazy, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.81,0:53:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们 跟死有什么两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us. We good as dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.14,0:53:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 别再唧唧歪歪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop your whining, Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.56,0:53:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要唧唧歪歪 怎样 我一巴掌扇得你满眼冒金星\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you gonna do if I don't stop, huh? I will slap the hell out of you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.36,0:54:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.61,0:54:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一个大嘴巴把你抽回非洲 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll bitchslap you back to Africa! - Oh, you will?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.03,0:54:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我倒想见识见识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Come on, let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.65,0:54:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我见识见识啊 - 来啊 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna see you do that! - Come on. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.91,0:54:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,老虎的屁股你都敢摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know who you're messing with!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.78,0:54:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,鳄鱼的牙你都敢拔 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know who you're messing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.79,0:54:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等我把你鼻子咬掉 - 你咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll bite your damn nose off, man. - You bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.87,0:54:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.63,0:54:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任她
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.22,0:54:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她留在这儿是个错误
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.43,0:54:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有命令 现在不能动她
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.85,0:54:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把她可爱的小嘴唇儿 从她脸上切下去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.44,0:54:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后跟那两个蠢警察一起 埋在沙漠里
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.91,0:54:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃苹果吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some apple?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.79,0:54:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那把刀拿开 贱货 别搞出意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd put that knife away, bitch, before you have an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.59,0:55:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no use, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.26,0:55:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我三合会会怎么杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me how the Triads are gonna kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.84,0:55:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会折磨我们三日\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will torture us for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.72,0:55:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这我撑得住 - 然后让我们断子绝孙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can handle that. - Then they'll cut off our egg rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.19,0:55:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,断子绝孙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cutoff our egg rolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.77,0:55:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们快逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, no! Let's get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.02,0:55:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 老兄 别放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man! Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.74,0:55:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想死 - 别吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't wanna die! - Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.74,0:55:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把左腿给我 - 干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, give me your left leg. - What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.50,0:55:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,左腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left leg! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.79,0:55:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.59,0:55:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 站稳 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold tight. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.68,0:55:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 咬它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Bite that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.10,0:56:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬它像猴子一样咬它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite it! Bite it like a little monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.19,0:56:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力咬对 使劲儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, bite it! There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.31,0:56:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力 用你的虎牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yank it! Use them tiger teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.77,0:56:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯呀 差不多了 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Grab it, pull on it! You almost got it, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.57,0:56:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.70,0:56:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.12,0:56:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我松绑 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, untie me. Hurry up, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.12,0:56:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人像里全是钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these statues full of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.22,0:56:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 班杰明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Benjamin!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.01,0:56:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么 - 我在搜集证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I'm taking this for evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.02,0:56:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.35,0:56:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉到了吗？- 对 我们慢下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You feel that? - Yeah, we slowing down, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.83,0:57:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事 - 我来告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I'll tell you what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.67,0:57:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.92,0:57:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特 上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter, go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.43,0:57:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter! Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.04,0:57:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡特 - 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carter! - Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.83,0:57:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生什么事 - 你丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - You left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.63,0:57:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 我在车顶等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't leave you, man. I was waiting up there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.23,0:58:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我才不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, man! I ain't going in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.10,0:58:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点儿 - 那里有老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - There's rats in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.90,0:58:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有老鼠 - 看那只老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's no rats! - Look at that rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.34,0:58:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯维加斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Las Vegas?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.38,0:58:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌城 我们来这里干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vegas? What the hell we doing in Vegas?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.34,0:58:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 赤龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Red Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.97,0:58:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谭瑞奇游艇的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the name of Ricky Tan's boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.81,0:58:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.85,0:58:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是洗一亿元黑钱的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you launder a hundred million dollars in cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.27,0:58:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.15,0:58:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.44,0:58:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个一个来嘛 你有什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}One at a time. What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.40,0:58:58.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（赤龙赌场）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.99,0:59:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a second, man. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.41,0:59:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不能这样子进去 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't go in there like this. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.29,0:59:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要「潮」一点 - 什么「潮」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta look fly. - What you mean fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.71,0:59:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在赌城人靠衣装 我们不能就这么进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mack out. We can't go in there like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.67,0:59:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 衣装\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean, mack out?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.17,0:59:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来吧 亚洲兄弟 我带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me, my Asian brother. I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.50,0:59:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.35,0:59:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们就是来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where we're going, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.22,0:59:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去后 你跟我站开一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we get there, you stay a couple steps behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.60,0:59:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有点臭味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? You smell funky.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.89,0:59:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你踩到老鼠屎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you stepped in some rat shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.77,0:59:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这以前是牛仔帽 现在是太阳帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a cowboy hat, and now it's a pith helmet, and once.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.19,0:59:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我回头再跟你谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up. I'll talk to you in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.53,0:59:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 有什么可效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Can I help you gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.20,0:59:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑西装 裤长42\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm gonna need black, 42 long…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.99,0:59:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我除了真丝什么也不穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nothing touches this body but pure silk.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.24,0:59:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我搭档在童装部找套衣服吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get my partner something from the Kids Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.62,0:59:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那位搭档也要穿真丝吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would your partner like to be wrapped in silk as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.16,0:59:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人认为很老套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people think it's tacky…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.71,0:59:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我喜欢恋人穿情侣装\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I really enjoy it when couples dress alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.79,0:59:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是恋人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this ain't no couple thing, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.84,0:59:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是警察 在查危险的案件 需要乔装\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're police officers. We're working a case, and we need clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.88,0:59:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人追我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. There are a lot of men chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.84,1:00:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当然会追你们 不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}As well they should be. Listen, you have nothing to worry about, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.84,1:00:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你俩变成全场的焦点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna turn you two into the belle of the ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.01,1:00:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.35,1:00:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先来吧 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start with you, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.97,1:00:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有咖啡色的面孔 皮肤很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the mochaccino face, wonderful skin…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.31,1:00:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,宽阔的肩膀 就放只死动物在你身上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the big, broad shoulders. Let's put a dead animal on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.15,1:00:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,鳄鱼皮 奶油色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Croc skin. Butter cream, butter cream, croc skin, butter cream.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.19,1:00:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,腰围几寸我们进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What size is the waist? Let's go in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.36,1:00:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想… - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna… - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.74,1:00:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱碰我 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, sweetness.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.45,1:00:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他很火爆啊 - 蜜糖杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got fire to him. - Honey cups!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.28,1:00:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢 - 去拿衣服吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like that. - Go get the clothes! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.53,1:00:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找几件出来 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pull some items. Ooh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.37,1:00:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好有性格 我很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, ha. Lil Kim, I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.41,1:00:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有看到吗？- 他喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see that? - He likes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.67,1:00:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再和你一起购物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not shopping with you no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.29,1:00:37.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（开张大吉）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.72,1:00:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,装作你很有钱的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Act like you're rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.97,1:00:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.76,1:00:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂芬瑞恩 赤龙赌场的所有者及创办人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steven Reign, owner and founder of the Red Dragon casino.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.60,1:00:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.23,1:01:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 大家晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.82,1:01:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千年前 中国有个富庶的小村\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand years ago, a small, wealthy village in China…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.41,1:01:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,村民们请了一条龙看守山洞的宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}hired a young dragon to guard their treasures in a cave.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.08,1:01:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,村民给它送去很多食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people of the village started sneaking him extra food…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.83,1:01:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它越来越强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}hoping to make him stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.71,1:01:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙后来长得太肥大了 塞在洞口\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dragon grew so big he got stuck…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.63,1:01:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝藏此永远藏在它后面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the treasure was trapped behind him for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.01,1:01:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 我找到了 那失踪的宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, I have found that lost treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.35,1:01:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就在这间世界上最大的赌场中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is here, inside the greatest casino in the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.85,1:01:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来赤龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Red Dragon…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.19,1:01:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里人人都是赢家\N{\fnArial\fs30}where everybody is a winner!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.79,1:02:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑 29\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black, 29.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.55,1:02:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是世界最大的洗钱场所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this place, Lee. It's the biggest front in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.22,1:02:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.81,1:02:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 喝点什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.48,1:02:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抽烟吗？- 要喝点什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cigarettes? - Drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.56,1:02:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your arms around me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.48,1:02:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 抱紧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Hold me close.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.48,1:02:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到处是摄像头\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are cameras everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.57,1:02:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我可能遇到麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - I think I may be in trouble, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.07,1:02:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.53,1:02:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次你要帮忙 我醒来发现自己就在货车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time you needed my help, I woke up in a truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.04,1:02:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卧底 我没选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm undercover, Lee. I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.83,1:02:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.25,1:02:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我右后方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look over my right shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.92,1:02:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是数钞票的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the soft count room.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.34,1:02:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们猜印版就在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think the plates are in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.50,1:02:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你去拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to go and get them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.67,1:02:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go get them?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.22,1:02:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我若猜错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if I'm wrong…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.63,1:02:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,身份就会被揭穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}then my entire cover is blown, understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.85,1:02:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎知道可以信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know I can trust you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.14,1:02:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,揽我入怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dip me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.85,1:03:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在认真地请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking for real now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.98,1:03:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以帮特勤局一个忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help the Secret Service?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.53,1:03:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lee. Lee!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.12,1:03:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.25,1:03:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, man. Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.79,1:03:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dancing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.04,1:03:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dancing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.29,1:03:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里工作 出生入死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm up here working, putting my life on the line…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.71,1:03:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却跟无脑美女跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're up here messing around, dancing with some bimbo?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.63,1:03:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有带朋友来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she have a friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.01,1:03:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是伊莎贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Isabella.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.80,1:03:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说印版在数钞室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the plates are in the soft count room.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.85,1:03:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 你不是说伊莎贝拉吧 你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, I know you didn't just say Isabella. Are you crazy, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.10,1:03:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那女人又来陷害你了 - 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That girl is setting you up again. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.23,1:03:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我要去看看 - 不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna find out. - No, wait, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.40,1:03:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处是保安 你要声东击西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's security all over. If you're gonna do this, you need a distraction.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.94,1:03:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去引开注意 你伺机行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So keep your eye on me, you'll know when to make your move.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.40,1:03:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - Cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.12,1:03:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 掷骰子吧 大老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, roll them, big daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.83,1:04:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 德州佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Tex! Come on, Tex!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.54,1:04:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! Good roll, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.79,1:04:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张桌子很旺啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This table's hot!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.09,1:04:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想赢点钱 我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want some of this money. Get me in this game. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.72,1:04:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留意到今晚最少要换 五万元筹码吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, uh, are you aware that there's a $50, 000 buyin this evening?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.93,1:04:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么给我十万元筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's the case, give me $100, 000 in chips.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.22,1:04:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要健怡百事可乐和辣鸡翅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me have a diet Pepsi and some hot wings.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.43,1:04:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给他筹码 - 我们来玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give him the chips. - Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.73,1:04:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要赢点钱 等一下 每个筹码多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! I'm gonna get some of this. Whoa, whoa, whoa. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.27,1:04:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百元 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fivehundreddollar chips, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.81,1:04:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是黑人 你就给我五百元的筹码吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me 500dollar chips because I'm black?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.15,1:04:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先生 我只是以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, sir, I did not. I just assumed that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.65,1:04:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为黑人兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assumed a brother coming in here…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.40,1:04:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只玩得起五百元的筹码吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}can only afford $500 a roll. Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.03,1:04:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我完全没那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, I didn't think that at all, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.41,1:04:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你种族歧视吗？- 不 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You a racist? - No, I'm not, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.45,1:04:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么人人都有一千元的筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come everybody else got thousanddollar chips…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.58,1:04:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只有黑人的是五百元的 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- black man got a nickel? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.62,1:04:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.88,1:04:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这么 - 就这么发生了是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It just… - It just happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.29,1:04:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太过份了 你以为我们受了362年奴役\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, this is crazy. You think my people suffered 362 years of slavery…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.55,1:04:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以给我五百元筹码 让我回去种棉花吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you could send us back to the cotton fields with 500dollar chips?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.93,1:04:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是的 - 我像黑奴乔治吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Do I look like Chicken George?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.80,1:04:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不像 - 那你是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do not. - What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.18,1:04:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我觉得你该冷静一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I think you should calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.26,1:05:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你应该哪儿凉快哪儿待着去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go over there and count something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.52,1:05:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把筹码给我 我要一千元的 - 等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want thousanddollar chips! - Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.02,1:05:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我只想要被公平对待 这样的要求过份吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna be treated fairly. Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.44,1:05:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不过分 - 这样的要求过份吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.94,1:05:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 真不知道发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Who knows what going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.94,1:05:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,九号桌有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a problem on table 9.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.37,1:05:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没黑人表演 黑人不够好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come ain't no black people performing? We ain't good enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.83,1:05:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱诺李奇今晚演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got Lionel Richie performing here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.00,1:05:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自从担任「海军准将」主唱 之后就不是黑人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lionel ain't been black since the Commodores, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.21,1:05:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「桃子和草」、「葛蕾蒂丝奈特与种子合唱团」呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Peaches and Herb? Gladys Knight and the Pips?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.00,1:05:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「艾克和蒂娜」呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ike and Tina.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.38,1:05:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以复合呀 太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can get back together. This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.88,1:05:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 何不冷静一下 赢点钱尽兴一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you calm down, win some money and have fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.76,1:05:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷什么静 我讨厌你老叫我冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't calming down! I'm sick of you trying to calm me down!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.10,1:05:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有麻烦 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a problem. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.66,1:06:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a dream…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.99,1:06:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望白人和黑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that white people and black people…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.87,1:06:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至中国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even Chinese people…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.42,1:06:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以在同桌赌钱 用筹码一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}can gamble together without getting different chips!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.72,1:06:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在兄弟份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it, hold it. In the spirit of brotherhood…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.05,1:06:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们掷骰子吧 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's just play craps, man. Come on, let's go. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.08,1:06:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.66,1:07:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.54,1:07:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.50,1:07:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.33,1:08:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,李督察 这是颗樱桃炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.58,1:08:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不听话的话
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.00,1:08:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我轻轻一按
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.13,1:08:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,32颗顽皮的牙就会蹦进你的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.68,1:08:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,六点是赢家 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winner, 6. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.60,1:08:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.51,1:08:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉很棒 刚才谁摸我屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel good. Oh, who put their hand on my butt?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.39,1:08:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来把 把骰子给我 我赢了多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it again. Give me that, give me that. How much I win?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.35,1:08:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十万 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hundred thousand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.98,1:08:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hundred thousand dollars?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.86,1:08:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Whoo! All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.82,1:08:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,掷吧 我要掷七点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming out. This seven I'm about to roll…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.07,1:08:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为曼德拉坐的27年冤狱而掷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is for the 27 years Mandela spent in that prison, couldn't get no justice…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.74,1:08:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吃尽苦头 所以我不会掷输\N{\fnArial\fs30}and took all that crap. I ain't gonna crap out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.12,1:08:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会输的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.37,1:08:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为曼德拉而掷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is for Mandela!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.79,1:08:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,七点 七点赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A winner, seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.13,1:08:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,终获自由 终获自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free at last. Free at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.17,1:08:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,终获自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.50,1:08:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,终获自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.89,1:09:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.94,1:09:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,试想像有一种生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine a business…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.90,1:09:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都给你钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}where people hand you money…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.70,1:09:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给他们的回报 却完全是零\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you hand them back absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.79,1:09:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是真正的美国梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's the real American dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.96,1:09:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,托几片金属的福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to a few pieces of metal…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.83,1:09:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上美国最漂亮的海关人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a most beautiful U.S. customs agent…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.25,1:09:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我东山复出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back in business.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.22,1:09:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.64,1:09:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的样子真是糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.94,1:09:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你本来没必要落得如此下场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it didn't have to be like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.23,1:09:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.07,1:10:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其父必有其子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like father, like son.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.57,1:10:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板 他去顶楼了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.33,1:10:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个老笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this old fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.45,1:10:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为自己在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.79,1:10:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要找一个可靠而忠心的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, it's almost impossible to find a partner…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.38,1:10:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎是不可能的 李 同意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is trustworthy and loyal. Don't you agree, Lee?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.76,1:10:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止下注 所有人都别碰这桌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything stays on the table. Don't nobody touch that table.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.43,1:10:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.85,1:10:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢家四点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winner, four high, four high.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.48,1:10:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.98,1:10:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是五十万元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness! That's $500, 000!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.98,1:10:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五十万 - 下来 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! That's $500, 000! - Come on, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.65,1:10:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们拿下李的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.03,1:10:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我换现金 - 请先下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cash me out. - You're gonna have to get off the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.66,1:10:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.66,1:11:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭档的问题是 他们会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trouble with partners is they die.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.25,1:11:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.14,1:11:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩开心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.10,1:11:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过几分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.61,1:11:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会主动求我按这个
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.53,1:11:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 美国特勤局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move! U.S. Secret Service!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.45,1:11:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.72,1:11:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会护送你去出纳部\N{\fnArial\fs30}These gentlemen will escort you to the cashier.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.26,1:11:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 以免有钱白人拦途截劫 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I don't wanna getjumped by any of these rich white folks. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.95,1:12:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 安全第一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate this, fellas. You never can be too safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.63,1:12:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.10,1:12:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 痛吗？- 你 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, man. Did that hurt? - Hey! you! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.85,1:12:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You okay? You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.12,1:13:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑人赢大钱你们就眼红了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black man on a roll, y'all start tripping.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.62,1:13:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都后退 冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all get back! Just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.75,1:13:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 后退 后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said back! Get back! Get back! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.22,1:13:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 住手下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Hey, stop! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.55,1:13:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 放松 把棍子放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Drop the stick.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.35,1:13:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.77,1:13:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 你去了哪儿我赢了大钱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you been, Lee? I've been on a roll, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.66,1:13:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.20,1:13:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你口里的光是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that light?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.83,1:13:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 大事不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, man, this can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.68,1:14:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 别挡路 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Would you get out of my way?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.15,1:14:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.07,1:14:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.12,1:14:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.56,1:14:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛不跟我说口里有炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't tell me you had a bomb in your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.02,1:14:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了 - 不 你没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did! - No, you didn't!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.27,1:14:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我这么说的 - 这是啥意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said "mm"! - What the hell is "mm"?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.61,1:14:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭瑞奇没有死 我们得去顶楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky Tan's still alive. We have to get to the penthouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.24,1:14:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谭瑞奇已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ricky Tan dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.07,1:14:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胡说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you talking about? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.83,1:15:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去找瑞奇 我来对付她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee. Go after Ricky, man. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.54,1:15:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡特 - 去吧 这里我搞得定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carter. - Just go, man. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.59,1:15:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我不会因为你是女人手下留情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hold back this time just because you're a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.47,1:15:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会当你是男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna pretend you're a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.18,1:15:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个身材完美的俊男\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very beautiful man with a perfect body…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.77,1:15:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会约他看电影的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who I'd like to take to the movies.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.11,1:15:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一招不懂吧 埃及拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know nothing about this? Egyptian style, girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.45,1:15:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,想试试这个吗 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some of this? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.83,1:15:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo, ah! Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.42,1:15:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah. I'm fine. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.42,1:16:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need help.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.14,1:16:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前不知道你到底是哪方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know which side you were on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.06,1:16:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.81,1:16:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底有什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you, woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.52,1:16:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好香啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, you smell good.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.71,1:17:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 班杰明 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Benjamin. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.92,1:17:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩本是天生一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have been a good couple.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.72,1:17:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以产生些浪漫的火花\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have had something special.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.05,1:17:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你是个疯婆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you one crazyass bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.36,1:17:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人真爱赌博 对吗 瑞恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Americans love to gamble, don't they, Mr. Reign?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.19,1:17:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不赌博\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never gamble.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.41,1:17:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要提早结束我俩的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm, uh, cutting our deal short.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.83,1:17:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我的印版呢 - 印版归我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And my plates? - The plates stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.58,1:17:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你不会反对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you won't have a problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.63,1:18:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢你那个龙和宝藏的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enjoyed that little story you told about the dragon and the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.63,1:18:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈以前常跟我说那故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother used to tell it to me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.76,1:18:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那故事的寓意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know the moral of that story?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.51,1:18:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,贪得无厌没好下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greed will imprison us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.02,1:18:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌迷信的胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate that fortunecookie shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.00,1:18:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你爸爸一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.58,1:18:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来真的想帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really did try to help him, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.92,1:18:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他分赃\N{\fnArial\fs30}To share with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.09,1:18:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你生活过得好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make your life better.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.92,1:18:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜他太软弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was too weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.34,1:18:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,太害怕转变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too afraid of change.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.51,1:18:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把印版给我 都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the plates. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.68,1:18:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.72,1:18:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这国家到处都是赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are casinos all over this country.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.60,1:19:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 我可以让你飞黄腾达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make you a very rich man, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.69,1:19:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要重蹈你爸爸的覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make the same mistake your father did.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.98,1:19:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你碰那枪的话 我便会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you reach for that gun, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.70,1:19:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得吗 我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you remember? I'm already dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.66,1:19:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞奇 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ricky. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.54,1:19:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 你似乎已经控制大局了 我得去楼下 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you got everything under control. I'm gonna go downstairs Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.34,1:19:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞恩怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Reign?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.92,1:19:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道你爸爸是怎样死的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like me to tell you how your father died?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.18,1:19:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. Wait one second, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.43,1:19:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得杀他 他想让你中圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't worth it, man. He trying to trick you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.64,1:19:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太过份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go too far, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.89,1:19:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从不会贪生怕死 也不肯同流合污\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never begged for his life or tried to make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.39,1:19:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把枪放下 - 我开枪前那片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put the gun down. - All he asked me…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.35,1:19:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是恳求我\N{\fnArial\fs30}just seconds before I pulled the trigger…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.86,1:19:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应他不杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}was that I promise not to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.19,1:19:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太可悲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was so pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.65,1:19:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 他太过份了 开枪吧 蹦死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell, no. He don't went too far. Shoot his ass now, Lee. Shoot his ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.41,1:19:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do, Lee?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.78,1:19:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要按下扳机 然后：\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do is pull that trigger back and bam!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.45,1:19:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算余生像你爸爸一样躲藏吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to spend the rest of your life hiding like your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.58,1:20:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他那样说你爸爸 开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him talk about your daddy like that. Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.08,1:20:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做不到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do it, can you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.54,1:20:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得到的 这里只有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, hell, you can. Ain't nobody up here but us.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.75,1:20:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀死他吧… - 正如我所料\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go off on him. - Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.51,1:20:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用的是激将法 开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He trying to punk you. Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.26,1:20:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 不开枪也揍扁他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! If you ain't, kung fu his ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.39,1:20:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carter! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.31,1:20:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.87,1:20:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.37,1:20:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,李 好脚法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good kick, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.29,1:20:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.33,1:20:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 我们说他想坐车就好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. We'll say he tried to catch a cab.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.25,1:20:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手中的是 该死的 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that in your? Aw, hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.17,1:20:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 听我说 快放下那炸弹 关掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, listen to me. Put that bomb down and turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.22,1:20:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡特 我们得跳出去 - 你疯了 我才不跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carter, we have to jump! - You crazy, man. I ain'tjumping.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.93,1:20:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的外套吧 关掉炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your jacket! Hey, turn that bomb off! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.89,1:21:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazyass!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.41,1:21:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.28,1:21:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信我飞了一万英里 就为了来搅这滩浑水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe I flew 10, 000 miles for this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.34,1:22:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,李探员 我不想承认 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective Lee, I hate to admit it…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.34,1:22:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国特勤局真的很感激你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the United States Secret Service is indebted to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.88,1:22:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.30,1:22:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机上见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you on board. Mmhm.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.68,1:22:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想多谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna thank you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.57,1:22:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你合作很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was nice working with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.96,1:22:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.37,1:22:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这狡猾的王八蛋 她吻了你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sly devil, you. She kissed you, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.09,1:22:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也很酷啊 头也不回 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you played it cool too. Walking away, not looking back. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.42,1:22:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是老手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm a player.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.93,1:23:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她飞去哪儿 - 她去纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she headed? - She's going to New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.18,1:23:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的登机门在那边 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that your gate down there? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.94,1:23:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的登机门在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.02,1:23:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那表示我们得说再见了 - 大概是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guess that mean goodbye. - I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.19,1:23:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.20,1:23:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己多保重 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take good care of yourself, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.62,1:23:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 卡特 - 怎么了 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Carter. - Yeah, Lee?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.41,1:23:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.42,1:23:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个东西想给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something I want you to have.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.30,1:23:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你爸爸的警徽 我不能要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man. This is your daddy's badge. I can't take that, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.05,1:23:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我终于可以放下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. No. Finally, I can let it go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.55,1:23:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.64,1:23:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我也有个东西给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know what? I got something for you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.23,1:23:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.48,1:23:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一万美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's $10, 000, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.02,1:23:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今早在凯撒赌场赢的 我的手气仍然很旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it at the tables this morning at Caesars. I'm still hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.86,1:23:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能要 - 别担心 我还有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't take this. - Don't worry about it. I got a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.69,1:23:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 拿去 好好享受一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no. - Go ahead. Enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.57,1:23:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Carter. I can't have this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.11,1:24:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时放下警察的包袱去享乐一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you stop acting like a cop for one second, man, and live it up?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.16,1:24:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有你想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There gotta be something you want. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.62,1:24:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.29,1:24:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞往纽约的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Final boarding call for flight 44…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.54,1:24:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,44号班机的乘客 请尽快到登机门\N{\fnArial\fs30}to New York City's LaGuardia. All ticketed passengers should now…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.83,1:24:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想去麦迪逊广场花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wanted to go to Madison Square Garden…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.55,1:24:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看纽约尼克斯队的篮球赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}see the Knicks play.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.84,1:24:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 纽约市 - 头等舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- New York City? - First class.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.13,1:24:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 广场酒店 - 也许来点木须肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Plaza Hotel? - Maybe a little mu shu?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.43,1:24:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen to that, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.01,1:24:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 你意下如何 - 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what do you say? - You know what, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.39,1:24:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全可以再休一次假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can use another vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.86,1:24:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,打板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.53,1:24:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开拍 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Action! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.82,1:24:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 拿好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.85,1:25:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 他没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.06,1:25:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,成龙没事吧 成龙总是没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackie okay? Jackie always okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.90,1:25:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是犹太餐吗？- 是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this the kosher meal? - Yes, that's our kosher meal.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.28,1:25:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这叫什么名字 - 鱼丸冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the name of it? - Gefilte fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.74,1:25:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鱼丸冻 - 鱼丸冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gefilte fish. - Gefilte fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.36,1:25:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,熏鲑鱼贝果 我最喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lox and bagels. It's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.66,1:25:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这东西叫什么名字 - 鱼丸冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the name of this stuff? - Gefilte fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.12,1:25:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼冻丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gefilke fishOh.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.58,1:25:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这鱼叫什么名字 - 鱼丸冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the name? - Gefilte fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.71,1:25:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼冻丸 鱼丸冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gefilke fiGefilta.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.75,1:25:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么吗 是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what this is? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.09,1:25:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鱼冻丸 - 是鱼丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gefilte fish. - It's filte fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.76,1:25:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼丸 你想吃我的鱼丸吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filte fish. Want some of my filte fish?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.67,1:25:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吃我的什么丸来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want any of this sh? Uh, what's the name of the fish?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.72,1:25:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼丸冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gefilte fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.01,1:25:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼丸冻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gefilte fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.76,1:25:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼丸冻 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gefilte fish. All right, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.64,1:25:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鱼丸冻 我喜欢 - 我才不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gefilte. I love this stuff. - I really don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.56,1:25:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的黑人都吃这个 谁会吃熏鲑鱼贝果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black people all over eating this. Who eats lox and bagels?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.11,1:25:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以吃鱼丸冻吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have some gilte fish?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.46,1:26:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 成龙 踢门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady! Jackie, kick.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.87,1:26:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 克里斯塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Chris Tucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.79,1:26:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,成龙 踢门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackie, kick it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.09,1:26:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,又叫成龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackie again?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.26,1:26:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们倒想见识见识 成龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd love to see that. Won't we love to see that, Jackie.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.43,1:26:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,成龙 我们倒想见识见识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackie, we'd like to see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.47,1:26:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,成龙 我们倒想见识见识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackie, we would love to see that. Wouldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.81,1:26:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的名字是李 该死的 - 李 我们得见识见识\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His name is Lee, goddamn it! - Lee, we would love to see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.56,1:26:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们倒想见识见识 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't we, Lee?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.02,1:26:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一定有你想要的 - 我一直想去广场麦迪逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gotta be something you want. - I always want to go to SquareMadi.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.98,1:26:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想去广场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always want to go to SquareShh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.98,1:26:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直梦想去广场麦顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always dream to Square Margon.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.32,1:26:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always want to go to.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.99,1:26:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我不能集中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.24,1:26:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很紧张 每次说到「花园」就紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm nervous. Every "garden", I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.25,1:26:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦迪逊广场花园 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Madison Square Garden. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.12,1:26:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想去广麦迪逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always want to go to the SqMadison.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.67,1:27:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人追我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of men chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.00,1:27:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当然会追 你这么英俊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're a very goodlooking man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.92,1:27:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没女友也会追你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't have a girlfriend, I'd take run at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.43,1:27:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会放你在浴缸 给你水泡 拍你屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put you in a bubble bath, put water wings on you, spank your little bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.93,1:27:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但听着 我们现在要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, here's what we.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.97,1:27:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇定点 你笑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy. Look it. You're giggling at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.43,1:27:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心我带你回家罚你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you home and just punish you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.56,1:27:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个我都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need both of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.06,1:27:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这狡猾的混蛋 她吻了你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sly devil, you. She kissed you, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.57,1:27:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.24,1:27:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 谁打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OhHold on Who's calling?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.28,1:27:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟你老爸打个招呼吧 - 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say hello to your dad. - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.95,1:27:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.66,1:27:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在拍戏 七点钟再打来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm filming, man. IS Call me back at 7:00.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.04,1:27:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在拍戏 瞪着成龙 再打来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking Jackie Chan dead in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.04,1:27:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在镜头上 再打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the Call me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.54,1:27:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回头再打给我 - 你也太不专业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call me back. - Are you a professional?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.54,1:27:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可是在拍戏啊 你还开着手机 - 不 你不能跟成龙说话 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are filming, you turn on your phone? - No, you can't speak to Jackie Chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.13,1:27:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 他们想跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. They wanna speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.92,1:27:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - I'm sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.84,1:27:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在拍戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are filming right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.93,1:27:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不好意思呢 你在浪费我们的底片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sorry? You waste our film.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.89,1:27:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点打来吧 七点钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me back later, 7:00.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.36,1:28:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.94,1:28:08.48,Title,0,0,0,0,,他不会在《尖峰时刻3》出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't gonna be in Rush Hour 3.
